      "statement": "`buildDeliveryDeployment` renders one compose service per Context with `EVIDENCE_MODEL`, `EVIDENCE_CONTEXT`, `EVIDENCE_SERVICE_KIND` and `EVIDENCE_BASE_PATH`, `dependsOn` taken exactly from the links leaving that service and `expose` from the route lanes it serves; images and ports are placeholders, so the file is a sketch rather than a release.",
