      "id": "claim_6eb13e0f52e24fab82871892ad923c37",
      "statement": "Addressing is derived rather than assigned: `rawSegmentOf` folds the last dotted id part into a path word, `createSegmentAllocator` disambiguates only clashes inside one id category with `-<category>` and then `-<category>-<n>` suffixes, and `operationIdFor` builds the camel-cased operation id from verb plus id.",
